{"sourceUrl":"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/noticezs/1421803.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:36.300111+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/noticezs/1421803.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span><span>我院现组织开展</span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生报名工作，请符合申请条件的申请人（包括本校应届生）按以下通知内容报名：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（一）中华人民共和国公民</span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（二）拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法</span></span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span><span>品德良好</span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（三）在目前就读学校取得</span></span></span><span><span><span>/</span><span>预计可取得</span></span></span><span><span><span>教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生</span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（四）学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和作为博士、硕士研究生培养的潜质</span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（五）诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分</span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（六）</span></span></span><span><span>身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（七）入学前须本科毕业并获得学士学位</span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（八）</span></span></span><span><span>其余申请条件要符合中山大学推荐免试研究生招生章程及接收办法中的要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、招生专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>招收专业</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>方向</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>083100生物医学工程</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>（学术学位）</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>01生物医学材料</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>02生物医学传感</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>03医疗仪器</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>085409生物医学工程</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>69不分方向</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>086001生物技术与工程</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>69不分方向</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div> </div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span>说明：实际招生专业以学校最终公布的</span>202</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>年研究生招生专业目录为准。</span></span></span><span><span>各专业实际接收推免生人数将根据招生计划、生源情况等进行调整，以实际录取为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>申请</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）申请材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>1.《中山大学生物医学工程学院接收202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试生攻读研究生申请表》原件</span><span>1份；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2.一篇300-500字左右的科研兴趣自述；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>3.本科阶段成绩单及同年级总成绩排名1份（由教务部门或院系盖章）；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>4.身份证、学生证复印件各1份；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>5.四六级证书、或其他英语水平证明材料；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>6.其他：各类获奖证书、发表论文、专利证书等材料。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>以上材料请于</span><span>7月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>中午</span><span>12：00</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>前扫描，并制成一个</span><span>PDF文件（文件命名为拟报考学科方向-姓名-毕业学校-手机号码-预推免），材料须已填写并签名或盖章，并按以上1-6顺序依次排列，确保无误后在</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>公务云盘</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>上传提交</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>上传地址请查阅申请流程</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>申请</span></span></span><span><span>者</span></span><span><span><span>须承诺所提供信息、材料及申请身份的真实性。一经查证为不属实或不符合我校招生要求的，我校将取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>申请</span></span></span><span><span>者</span></span><span><span><span>若存在有违学术道德、专业伦理、诚实守信等方面的不当行为，一经查实，立即取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>申请流程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>网上报名：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>有</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>意向</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>的同学于</span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span><span>7月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>中午</span><span>12点</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>前登陆下面网址进行网上报名，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>并通过公务云盘提交申请材料。（两个步骤必须都完成视为报名成功）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>注意所有电子版申请材料信息必须与网报信息完全一致，否则将影响报名。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>1、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>具体报名网址：</span><span>https://wj.sysu.edu.cn/q/2Zsm9eYk</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2、申请材料提交地址：https://pan.sysu.edu.cn/link/AA85F62491ECD7413D82FC36DA777545D0</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>文件夹名：中大生医工</span><span>2027年推荐免试攻读研究生申请资料上传</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>提取码：</span><span>A2yR</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>文件命名：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>拟报考学科方向</span><span>-姓名-毕业学校-手机号码-预推免</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>初审与复试</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>学院将根据报名情况进行初步筛选，确定面试名单，并于学院官网公布。面试安排</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>为</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日，具体时间安排将另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>初审</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>招生单位组织</span></span><span><span>对申请材料初审后，通知</span></span><span><span>审核</span></span><span><span>通过的申请人参加复试。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>1. </span><span>复试形式：现场复试。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>. </span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复试总分：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>100<span>分</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，其中</span><span>30%</span><span>为英语考核，</span><span>70%</span><span>为业务能力及综合素质考核。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>3. </span><span>考核时间：硕士推免生的面试总时间不少于</span><span>20</span><span>分钟，直博生的面试总时间不少于</span><span>30</span><span>分钟。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>. </span></span></span><span><span><span>考核方式：面试。复</span></span></span><span><span>试小组对参加复试的考生进行逐个考核，考生当场回答问题或操作，必要时，复试小组成员会就相关问题进一步提问。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>5. </span></span></span><span><span>复试内容</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span><span>：重点考查考生的知识结构、</span></span></span></span><span><span>外语应用能力、专业素质及能力</span></span><span><span><span><span>、创新能力、写作水平</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span>思想政治素质和品德、心理健康状况等</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>6. </span><span>考核评分：每位考生复试结束后，由复试小组成员现场独立为考生评分。复试小组成员考核总分的算术平均值为该考生的最终复试成绩。成绩按四舍五入原则，保留小数点后两位。复试成绩不及格（低于</span><span>60</span><span>分）者，不予录取。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试实行差额复试，根据复试成绩择优录取，未按规定参加复试或复试不及格者不予录取。复试过程全程录音录像。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请者在参加复试时，须提供本人有效第二代居民身份证、学生证、加盖有推荐学校教务处公章的本科阶段学习成绩单</span></span><span><span>原件</span></span><span><span>，以备查验</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span><span>并携带上传的申请材料（</span><span>1-6</span><span>）一式五份到考核现场（双面</span><span>A4</span><span>打印，左上角斜订即可，不要装订成册或使用文件夹）</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>考核通过名单</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>公</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>布</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院将</span></span><span><span>根据复试情况，择优确定</span></span><span><span>考核通过</span></span><span><span>名单</span></span><span><span>并于我院官网公布。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>后续将</span></span><span><span><span>通过教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”向拟接收的申请人发送待录取通知，收到待录取通知的申请者，须在规定时间内在“推免服务系统”上完成待录取确认，逾期未完成确认者视为放弃待录取资格。在“推免服务系统”上完成待录取确认的推免生不得变更录取志愿，不得撤销待录取。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>其他</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>1.</span><span>说明</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>此通知为报名通知，具体要求以教育部及中山大学</span>202</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生</span></span></span><span><span>接收办法</span></span><span><span>及相关工作</span></span><span><span><span>通知为准。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>推免生的报名及录取均通过教育部</span><span>“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址</span></span></span><span><span>: https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/<span>）进行</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>推免复审及体检要求请留意学校及院系后续发布的推免接收办法及相关通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span><span>联系方式</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>联系人：中山大学生物医学工程学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>梁</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>老师</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>地址：深圳市光明区中山大学医学园</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>栋</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>办公室</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>0755-23260140</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>bmeyjs@mail.sysu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>生物医学工程</span></span><span><span><span>学院</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>附件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    <span>1. </span></span></span><a href=\"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/docs/20260707193111780645.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span>中山大学生物医学工程学院接收</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试生攻读研究生申请表</span></span></span></span></a></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"e4811df59c6485b3aae0716b2594550f86cca8d25814400b51e05ad50c39e79a","textLength":2277,"sourceSha256":"45c7a31bc2e4a5592525bc1641c3912c0084411c79668b3f30c1423a1d1e58e2","selector":".cont","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6b09bf5caf1243492e3c","title":"2026年中山大学生物医学工程学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:36.300111+00:00"}
